    "description": "Fuji United Holdings Company,Ltd. purchases and sells petroleum products in Japan. The company operates through the Oil Business, Recycling Business, Environment-Related Business, Home Energy Business, and Rental Business segments. It offers biodiesel fuels, recycled heavy oil, carbon offset fuels, fuel oils, asphalts, and lubricants, as well as AdBlue, a urea water for ammonia-based exhaust gas purification systems. The company also collects, transports, and processes industrial waste, as well as manufactures and sells recycled heavy oil; sells electricity generated by mega solar power plants; sells household fuel in small lots; and rents out construction machinery and other equipment. Fuji United Holdings Company,Ltd. was founded in 1949 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
